(11)
?Police Officer? means any member of the Police Force appointed or deemed to be appointed under this Act and
includes a special or an Additional Police Officer appointed under section 21 or 22;
(11A)
"Police Personnel" means any member of the Police Force appointed or deemed to be appointed under this Act;
(11B)
"post" means any post created on the establishment of Director General and Inspector General of Police and includes
the posts assigned for Police Personnel on State or Central deputation;"
(12)
?prescribed" means prescribed by rules;
(13)
?public place" includes the foreshore, the precincts of every public building or monument, and all places accessible to
